Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: nova
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-venv, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Offline AI storage optimizer
 NOVA scans a machine's local filesystem for reclaimable storage -
 duplicate files, stale downloads, orphaned apt packages, superseded
 kernels, and similar clutter - and recommends (or, with explicit
 approval, applies) cleanup actions.
 .
 It runs entirely offline: no scanned file contents or metadata ever
 leave the machine. Every action NOVA takes or recommends is written to
 a local, tamper-evident, hash-chained audit log, and a set of
 guardrails prevents it from ever touching sensitive system paths
 (SSH keys, git internals, etc.), regardless of what the OS-level file
 permissions would otherwise allow.
